# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A showcase pattern used as a BASE: the waving flag at 40 % opacity, the
# red-white-blue fireworks ADDED over it (the flag stays readable under the
# show), and burst sprites added on top, out of phase via their `A` rates.
# Designed at 32x32 (`U`): both patterns size themselves to the panel, and the
# three bursts zoom with it, so every panel gets the whole show.
S - Fourth of July
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 40 none fill 1
N Flag
I @pat/us-flag-2d
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Fireworks
I @pat/fireworks
C sliderPalette 131072
C sliderLaunchRate 3932160
L sprite 16 1 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Burst
I @spr/firework-burst
L sprite 1 9 0 0 add 100 none fill 3
N Burst 2
I @spr/firework-burst
A 7
L sprite 13 16 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Burst 3
I @spr/firework-burst
A 12
